OL,3,GNEWSAAlyn Smith appointed as Scotland's
OL,4,Ainnovation minister
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlyn Smith has been appointed as the
OL,7,FScottish government's new minister for
OL,8,Finnovation, technology and tertiary
OL,9,Feducation.
OL,11,FIt follows the resignation of Ben
OL,12,FMacpherson last week.
OL,14,FThe Scottish government said First
OL,15,FMinister John Swinney made the
OL,16,Fappointment via video call as Smith is
OL,17,Fcurrently suffering from a minor
OL,18,Fillness.
OL,20,FSmith became the MSP for Stirling in
OL,21,FMay following the Scottish Parliament
OL,22,Felection.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
